  "$comment": "Region geometry per console film plus its grade. `grade` overrides DEFAULT_GRADE in relight_console.py. 2026-09-21 second pass (the first read as foggy on the page): a whole-frame contrast S-curve (contrast 1.18 about L 0.72), a deeper structured icy room (env_*), 2px bordered panels with a real shadow, darker ink, deeper cyan/blue/violet signals, and walkers re-exposed with more local contrast (person_*); the MobilityCare film tones down the body overlay's chroma so the bloom at the walker's silhouette does not read as an aura. The script defaults are the washed-out 2026-09-14 edition.",
